    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドーミラーの　せなかの　もようには\nしんぴてきな　ちからが　やどると\nむかしの　ひとたちは　しんじていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "동미러의 등 모양에는\n신비한 힘이 깃들어 있다고\n옛날 사람들은 믿고 있었다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Les gens croyaient autrefois que les motifs de\nson dos renfermaient une puissance mystique.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Früher glaubten die Menschen, dem Muster auf\nseinem Rücken wohne eine mysteriöse Kraft inne.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Antaño se creía que en los dibujos de su parte\nposterior residía una fuerza misteriosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nell’antichità si credeva che una forza misteriosa\ndimorasse nei disegni sul dorso di Bronzor.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ancient people believed that the pattern on\nBronzor’s back contained a mysterious power.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ドーミラーの　背中の　模様には\n神秘的な　力が　宿ると\n昔の　人たちは　信じていた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Antaño se creía que en los dibujos de su parte\nposterior residía una fuerza misteriosa.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "ふるい　おはかから　ドーミラーに\nそっくりな　どうぐが　ほりだされたが\nかんけいは　わかっていない。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "고대 무덤에서 동미러와\n똑 닮은 도구가 발굴되었지만\n관계는 알 수 없다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il rappelle des objets trouvés dans des sépultures\nanciennes. Nul ne sait s’ils sont liés.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sein Körper sieht aus, als seien Teile davon\nin alten Gräbern gefunden worden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Se descubrieron herramientas con su forma en tumbas\nantiguas, pero se desconoce si tiene relación.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il suo aspetto ricorda alcuni oggetti ritrovati in\nantiche tombe, ma non si sa se ci sia una relazione.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "y",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/24/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Implements shaped like it were discovered in\nancient tombs. It is unknown if they are related.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
